e:["$","div",null,{"className":"method-grid","children":[["$","div","A claim is a testable object",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"A claim is a testable object"}],[["$","p","The suite treats a theorem, its executable statistic, its simulation cell, and its resulting figure as one chain. V0 audits deterministic identities and small full orbits. Later tracks are explicitly marked development or planned until a locked result exists.",{"children":"The suite treats a theorem, its executable statistic, its simulation cell, and its resulting figure as one chain. V0 audits deterministic identities and small full orbits. Later tracks are explicitly marked development or planned until a locked result exists."}],["$","p","Two modes prevent scope drift: theorem_core fixes common centering, zero ridge, a frozen candidate library, and the correct randomization unit; exploratory admits operational changes but cannot inherit theorem-aligned figure status.",{"children":"Two modes prevent scope drift: theorem_core fixes common centering, zero ridge, a frozen candidate library, and the correct randomization unit; exploratory admits operational changes but cannot inherit theorem-aligned figure status."}]]]}],["$","div","Failure is part of the result",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Failure is part of the result"}],[["$","p","Null controls measure global level rather than per-block behavior. Structured alternatives test power and rate only under their declared model. Mismatch cells perturb rank, localization, and distributional assumptions without silently changing the claim being evaluated.",{"children":"Null controls measure global level rather than per-block behavior. Structured alternatives test power and rate only under their declared model. Mismatch cells perturb rank, localization, and distributional assumptions without silently changing the claim being evaluated."}],["$","p","The current repository does not claim manuscript-level power, minimax, localization, or real-audio evidence. That visible boundary is intentional: a pending benchmark is different from a completed scientific result.",{"children":"The current repository does not claim manuscript-level power, minimax, localization, or real-audio evidence. That visible boundary is intentional: a pending benchmark is different from a completed scientific result."}]]]}]]}]
10:["$","p",null,{"children":"This rate belongs to the specified balanced Gaussian parameter space, not to every audio or covariance problem."}]
